   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Liquid Page Waves\n\nA page floats on a liquid surface: vertex waves and ripples roll across it with a slight camera tilt, intensify, and the page crossfades into a second one while the surface settles to still. WebGL over two built-in pages.\n\nCategory: transitions. Length: 12 s. WebGL: yes.\n\nUse when:\n- A fluid, rippling crossfade between two screens, for product tours and app showcases.\n- A page that should feel alive on a liquid surface before it changes.\n\nAvoid when:\n- Text-heavy screens that must stay perfectly readable during the transition.\n- A fast, hard cut.\n\nVariables:\n- brand (string): Panel A brand, default \"Vault\"\n- nav (string): Panel A menu, default \"Portfolio, Markets, Activity, Settings\"\n- balance_label (string): Panel A label, default \"TOTAL BALANCE\"\n- balance (string): Panel A value, default \"$2,847,391.24\"\n- change (string): Panel A change, default \"+12.4%\"\n- holdings (string): Panel A cards, default \"Savings | $1,204,000 | +4.2%; Equity | $862,310 | +18.9%; Bonds | $514,225 | +1.1%; Cash | $266,856 | -0.3%\"\n- author (string): Panel B author, default \"Sarah Chen\"\n- handle (string): Panel B handle, default \"@sarahchen\"\n- prompt (string): Panel B composer text, default \"Share an update\"\n- posts (string): Panel B posts, default \"Maya Okafor | Shipped the new dashboard today. The team did incredible work and the first numbers look great.; Leo Martins | Ten tiny experiments beat one big plan. Start small, learn fast.; Priya Nair | Morning reminder: take a walk before the standup.\"\n- resolution (number, 0.25-1): Resolution, default 0.75\n\nSource: heygen-com/hyperframes. Licence: Apache-2.0. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
